# cv-api REST Client
# Switch environment: status bar (bottom right), Cmd+Alt+E (Mac), Ctrl+Alt+E (Win/Linux), or F1 → "Rest Client: Switch Environment"
# Environments: local | fly
# /lighthouse uses LIGHTHOUSE_URL from server .env. Do not set it to a page that renders Lighthouse results.

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### GitHub stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/github/stats
Accept: application/json

### Lighthouse scores
GET {{baseUrl}}/lighthouse
Accept: application/json
